      "**Network posture**: None configured",
      "**Source control**: The trusted repo and its remote(s) only (no additional orgs configured) — github.com:necofuryai/necofuryai.dev, a PUBLIC repo, as scoped by the Trusted repo and Repository visibility entries above",
      "**Trusted internal domains**: necofuryai.dev and www.necofuryai.dev (the site this repo publishes); developers.cloudflare.com and raw.githubusercontent.com / api.github.com for docs and repo metadata reads",
